## Cybersecurity connection

Dictionaries are useful for storing structured security information.

Examples include:

```python
alert = {
    "severity": "High",
    "source_ip": "10.0.0.25",
    "malware_detected": True
}
```

They allow a program to keep related evidence together instead
of storing every piece of information in separate variables.
